Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 01:00:54 +0600
Subject: [PATCH 67/70] misc: samsung: scsc_bt: import 4.14 Bluetooth sources
 verbatim

Import, unmodified, the Samsung SCSC Bluetooth driver as a reference base
for the 6.18 forward-port (ADR-0008, native BlueZ). Source: A50 baseline
kernel, branch halium-a50-aa17rf2, commit 4f37ef39
(drivers/misc/samsung/scsc_bt), matching driver 11.19.0.18.0 and stock
firmware S620_E9610_R3-1_Y21W46A.

Sources: the H4 service/char-device module, the shared-memory transport,
scsc_bluez.c (native hci_dev; built off on stock), and the ANT, AVDTP
detection and QoS helpers, plus the BT host-interface API headers
(asmhcp, bhcs, bsmhcp) and the KIC BT/ANT headers. Nothing is built yet.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Change-Id: I70e2b5c010aaf5c582443e81c9441d4658fe42a0
